        <mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="§7.1. The graph shard holds topology only: every node, relationship, label and type. Property shards hold every { } block, hash-distributed by node." vertex="1">
